mission "The Shipwrights of Port de Lune"
    name "The Shipwrights of Port de Lune"
    description "Sail to Port de Lune and collect the plans from Master Shipwright Lenoir."
    source "Crown's Fall"
    destination "Port de Lune"
    lead "The harbourmaster passes you a note found among the cargo papers. “A broker in Crown’s Fall has been buying old ship plans and paying cash. Ask for Luc Vautrin. He has a message from the shipwrights at Port de Lune, who are being pressed into building gun decks for the Company. I do not know whether he is a fool or a Company man, but he may know who ordered the new hulls.”"
    reward 690
    speaker offer "Harbourmaster"
    speaker visit "Harbourmaster"
    speaker complete "Harbourmaster"
    to offer
        has "The Cane Wharf Raid: done"
    on offer
        conversation
            `A broker named Luc Vautrin has sent word from Port de Lune. The shipwrights there have been forced to build gun decks for the Meridian Company.`
            `They hid the plans for Ashcombe's new flagship inside a sailmaker's pattern book. The foreman will hand them over if you guarantee the workers safe passage.`
            `The plans show a broadside twice as heavy as Vane's old ship. They also reveal a weakness in the stern galleries.`
            choice
                `(I will take this voyage. Tell me the course.)`
                    goto accept_job
                `(What makes this business so important?)`
                    goto more_details
                `(I have other waters to sail.)`
                    goto decline_job
            label more_details
                `The plans show a broadside twice as heavy as Vane's old ship. They also reveal a weakness in the stern galleries.`
                choice
                    `(Then I will see it done.)`
                        goto accept_job
                    `(Not this time.)`
                        goto decline_job
            label accept_job
                `The island council pays for the workers' passage. “No one should have to build the chain that binds them,” the speaker says.`
                accept
            label decline_job
                `The officer nods and rolls the chart closed. The offer will remain here if you change your mind.`
                close
    on accept
        log "Accepted The Shipwrights of Port de Lune. Sail to Port de Lune and collect the plans from Master Shipwright Lenoir."
    on visit
        conversation
            `Lenoir gives you the plans and points to Santa Isabela, where Ashcombe is testing the new flagship.`
    on complete
        conversation
            `The flagship is called the Meridian Star.`
        log "Completed The Shipwrights of Port de Lune. Received 690 gold. The flagship is called the Meridian Star."
